  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "disc-terms",
   "title": "Disciplinary Committee — Terms",
   "body": "- The committee hears cases or complaints against students, interns or staff related to disputes, misbehaviour or indiscipline that jeopardise the interest of the institution.\n- It decides on suitable action or punishment and makes recommendations to the higher authorities for execution.\n- It maintains a separate file for circulars, documents and updated records."
